# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Frontend source/build tooling is not needed to compile the Go binary.
# Exclude it before the HTML re-include rule so node_modules/dist never enter
# the build context; the built portal lives at cmd/api-server/portal.html.
web/

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Re-include the built portal bundle for //go:embed
!cmd/api-server/portal.html
